# 0260 = 0259 + RX stall diagnostics only: RXSTALL dump on QISAR1 events
#   and 1 Hz for 5 s after the last RX packet; the 5 s ACM line gains
#   rxcur/rxdeq/rqhiar/rxhwo so a console photo captures the stall state.
